import scene_landscape_types.dl
import ../../packages/dynlex-ui/ui/scene_motion.dl
import ../../packages/dynlex-ui/ui/scene_attachments.dl
import lib/text.dl

class:
    patterns:
        website Farm character
    members:
        id as a string
        kind as an integer
        object as a pointer to UI scene object
        base as UI scene model
        motion as a pointer to UI scene motion
        seen as a boolean
        chopping as a boolean
        phase offset as a floating-point number
        legs as an integer array of 4 items
        arms as an integer array of 2 items
        hands as an integer array of 2 items
        inventory as an integer array of 2 items
        head as an integer
        tail as an integer

website Farm character list means: the type of (an empty list of a pointer to website Farm character)

class:
    patterns:
        website Farm characters
    members:
        landscape as a pointer to website Farm landscape
        entries as website Farm character list
        people as UI scene model array of 7 items
        cow as UI scene model
        chicken as UI scene model

to get [the website Farm heading for] {integer:direction}:
    return the item at direction in [3.141592653589793,1.5707963267948966,0.0,-1.5707963267948966]

to get [the website Farm character named] {a value:id} [in] {a pointer to website Farm characters:characters}:
    for each entry in (characters's entries):
        if entry's id = id:
            return entry
    return 0 as a pointer to website Farm character

to [remove website Farm scene object] {a pointer to UI scene object:object} [from] {a pointer to website Farm landscape:landscape}:
    loop index from 0 to (the length of landscape's objects):
        if (the item at index in (landscape's objects)) = object:
            remove item index from (landscape's objects)
            close UI scene object object
            return nothing
    require condition false reporting "The Farm scene does not own the removed object"

to get [a website Farm character named] {a value:id} [of kind] {integer:kind} [using] {UI scene model:model} [at] {vector:position} [facing] {integer:direction} [in] {a pointer to website Farm characters:characters}:
    set result to storage for one slot initialized with (a new website Farm character)
    set result's id to the string form of id
    set result's kind to kind
    set result's base to model
    set result's object to a website Farm object named id using model in (characters's landscape)
    set result's motion to a UI scene motion at position facing (the website Farm heading for direction) with stride 0.85
    set result's inventory to [-1,-1]
    set root to 0
    loop slot from 0 to (4 if kind = 1, else 2):
        store (the index of UI scene part named (formatted "leg {slot}") under root in model) into result's legs at slot
    if kind = 0:
        loop slot from 0 to 2:
            set arm to the index of UI scene part named (formatted "arm {slot}") under root in model
            store arm into result's arms at slot
            store (the index of UI scene part named (formatted "hand {slot}") under arm in model) into result's hands at slot
    else if kind = 1:
        set result's tail to the index of UI scene part named "tail" under root in model
    else:
        set result's head to the index of UI scene part named "head" under root in model
    append result to (characters's entries)
    return result

to [close website Farm character] {a pointer to website Farm character:character} [in] {a pointer to website Farm characters:characters}:
    remove website Farm scene object (character's object) from (characters's landscape)
    close UI scene motion (character's motion)
    destroy the value at character
    deallocate character
